<title>UK: Japanese stock market in London closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Japanese stock market in London closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Japanese share market in London was closed on Friday due to the continuing New Year holidays in Japan.</p>
<p>The Japanese share market will resume trade on Monday, January 6.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
</text>
